	quest.1A497608D1B4E276.quest_desc: [
		"&#ED76C9Mesprit &7is the &#ED76C9Being of Emotion&7, a &6legendary &#B73DB7Psychic &7Pokémon and part of &#C7FFD1Sinnoh's &#0044FFLake Guardians trio&7, known for teaching humans feelings like &ejoy&7, &9sorrow&7, and &4pain"
