	quest.1D13B7D70B8F5DC3.quest_desc: [
		"&bRegice &7is an &bIce&7-type &6Legendary &7Pokémon, one of the &4three Legendary Titans&7 created by &#B9A682Regigigas &7in ancient times. Its body is composed of &bAntarctic ice &7from an &bice age&7, which cannot be melted even by &4magma"
