		"&#3E3E3EGiratina &7the &#60266EGhost&7/&r&#1D1F93Dragon&7-type &7Renegade Pokémon, a &#761201primordial entity&7 created by &fArceus&7 alongside &r&#1D1F93Dialga &7and &#CD6CB5Palkia&7 to embody &0antimatter &7and manage the &0Distortion World"
